    PRACTICAL 4 - USERS, GROUPS AND PERMISSIONS
    ============================================================

    A. Create and manage a user
        sudo useradd labuser
        sudo passwd labuser
        id labuser
        getent passwd labuser
        sudo usermod -c "Lab User" labuser
        sudo userdel -r labuser

    Note: Run userdel only after you finish testing and only for the test account.

    B. Create and manage a group
